      "rackUnits": 1,
      "weightKG": 1.4,
      "notes": "48-point passive balanced TRS patchbay: 96 gold-plated 1/4\" TRS jacks as 48 rear and 48 front, giving 24 normalled channels. Each channel runs rear row A (source in) to rear row B (destination out); a rear-panel switch selects fully-normalled or half-normalled, which decides whether the front jacks tap or break that link. Each channel's front A jack taps or breaks the source, so it patches as a send; the front B jack feeds the destination, so it patches as a return. Wire the bay the other way round and the two rows swap roles. Passive, no power. Depth is approximate (dealer spec rounded to 10 cm).",
